        <div class="highlight-card">
          <div class="highlight-icon">📘</div>
          <h3>Educational Scope</h3>
          <p>Our calculators and articles serve informational and simulation objectives only. They do not constitute statutory advice or binding payroll documentation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-card">
          <div class="highlight-icon">🏛️</div>
