        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>2. Educational and Informational Nature of Calculators</h2>
        <p>
          The computational tools provided on 8PayCommission.com—including the 8th Pay Commission Salary Calculator, Pension Estimator, Arrears Simulator, and HRA/DA tools—are engineered solely for preliminary personal planning and simulation:
