            They do not represent legal payslips, binding administrative sanctions, or sanctioned government orders. Actual salaries, arrears, and pensions payable to civil servants are governed exclusively by official notifications issued in the Gazette of India or relevant State Government Orders.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>3. Non-Affiliation and Official Source Precedence</h2>
