        </p>
        <ul class="bullet-feature-list">
          <li><strong>No Official Connection:</strong> We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, sanctioned by, or in any manner officially connected to the Government of India, the Ministry of Finance, the Department of Expenditure, the Department of Personnel and Training (DoPT), or any State Government Finance Department.</li>
          <li><strong>Official Inquiries:</strong> The official portals of the Central Pay Commission, when constituted, are maintained exclusively under official government domains (such as gov.in or nic.in).</li>
          <li><strong>Precedence of Law:</strong> In any circumstance where information on this website diverges from an official gazetted resolution or ministerial circular, the official gazette notification takes absolute legal precedence.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

