        <h2>4. Intellectual Property and Permitted Use</h2>
        <p>
          The content, layout, computational design, interactive JavaScript code, and editorial text published on 8PayCommission.com are the intellectual property of the platform operators and are protected by applicable intellectual property and copyright laws.
        </p>
        <ul class="bullet-feature-list">
          <li><strong>Personal Non-Commercial Use:</strong> You are granted a limited, revocable license to access the content and tools for personal, non-commercial planning.</li>
          <li><strong>Restrictions:</strong> You may not copy, scrape, reproduce, sell, modify, or republish our calculator algorithms, software source code, or editorial compilations on other commercial websites or mobile applications without prior written authorization.</li>
          <li><strong>Citations:</strong> Academic, non-commercial, and journalistic citations are permitted provided clear attribution and a live hyperlink to the original source page on 8PayCommission.com are preserved.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, 8PayCommission.com, its authors, developers, and administrators shall not be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages resulting from:
        </p>
        <div class="compliance-box">
