        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>7. User Conduct and Security Obligations</h2>
        <p>
          When using this platform, you agree not to:
        </p>
        <ul class="bullet-feature-list">
          <li>Attempt to decompile, reverse engineer, or extract proprietary algorithmic logic from our client-side software tools.</li>
          <li>Use automated crawlers, bots, or scrapers to access or extract data from the website without our explicit permission.</li>
          <li>Transmit any malicious code, viruses, or disruptive scripts intended to compromise server performance.</li>
          <li>Transmit abusive, unlawful, or spam communications through our feedback forms or official contact email.</li>
        </ul>
