        <h2>8. Modifications to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to review, update, or revise these Terms of Condition at our discretion. Any adjustments will take effect immediately upon publication on this page with an updated revision date. Continued use of 8PayCommission.com following any modifications signifies your acceptance of the revised conditions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>9. Governing Law and Jurisdiction</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Condition and any disputes arising out of or related to the use of 8PayCommission.com shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Republic of India. Any legal action or proceeding related to this website shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts in India.
        </p>
