        <p>
          If you have questions, feedback, or require clarification regarding these Terms of Condition, please contact our administrative desk:
        </p>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-row">
            <span class="c-label">Official Email:</span>
            <a href="mailto:dailylifetech.official@gmail.com" class="c-link">dailylifetech.official@gmail.com</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-row">
            <span class="c-label">Website Domain:</span>
            <span>https://8paycommission.com</span>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-row">
